      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>FGL 31CM S MP 4M SW LRG SPRUCE

FLUSH WITH GROUND. 0.310 M SOUTH OF MP.7.6m NORTH WEST OF &quot;Y&quot; INTERSECTION OF HIKING TRAILS; 4m SOUTH WEST OF LARGE SPRUCE TREE</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="683833731">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="540154">One Bad Ant</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP544 - Page Avenue Trail - a quick find after a visit from a lovely dog named Lucy, then we visited George. We had such a busy day. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Road trip! Iron Phoenix and I had a fantastic caching and capping from Calgary to Red Deer. Thanks for the work you do maintaining the caps outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683671967">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP544 - Page Avenue Trail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time in Red Deer!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; This was our LAST cap of the day and the LAST findable cap in Red Deer! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; It was a nice quick find on a short walk and a good looking cap! Thanks for all the caps in Red Deer today! We had quite the adventure!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683267325">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="12442378">mikefromcanmore</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP544 Page Avenue Trail -  A quick find along a quiet trail.  There was a lot of individuals headed to the bottle depot nearby.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="682963074">
