          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP544 Page Avenue Trail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Really enjoyed this one as it took me around a great trail loop I would not have seen otherwise.

Some great caches along the way as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="680246138">
